# 120 BW-1: panel parts (machines/120-bw1/docs/BW1_DESIGN.md, Board). The keypad at the front
# right as the KIM's, 6 rows of 4; the display to its left, level with the AD row.
edge J1 left back                          # power
row back middle U1 U2 U3                   # the 6502 and the two 6530s: DIP-40s, no slot in the chip grid
row front right SW1 SW2 SW3 SW4            # 0 1 2 3
next SW5 SW1 back                          # 4 5 6 7
next SW6 SW2 back
next SW7 SW3 back
next SW8 SW4 back
next SW9 SW5 back                          # 8 9 A B
next SW10 SW6 back
next SW11 SW7 back
next SW12 SW8 back
next SW13 SW9 back                         # C D E F
next SW14 SW10 back
next SW15 SW11 back
next SW16 SW12 back
next SW17 SW13 back                        # AD DA PC +
next SW18 SW14 back
next SW21 SW15 back
next SW19 SW16 back
next SW20 SW17 back                        # GO ST RS SST
next SW22 SW18 back
next SW23 SW21 back
next SW24 SW19 back
next DS6 SW17 left                         # the display, DS1 on the left
next DS5 DS6 left
next DS4 DS5 left
next DS3 DS4 left
next DS2 DS3 left
next DS1 DS2 left
